<title>UK: Abbey National sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    18.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
